                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Well, I put a little over an hour into this game and finished it, here's my thoughts.\n\nFun game, I really liked the concept.. feels a bit like Plauge Inc, but more time spent in menus than looking at the map.\n\nI liked the humor, and twisting my Dad's arm for more money, buying the world was neat, and I liked the feeling of slowly taking it all over.. which comes to my only real beef with the game.  It's TOO FAST!!  Not so fast that I couldn't keep up, but too quick for me to really read the stock options I had, or to feel like I was doing much more than clikcing as fast as I could before my poor avatar died of old age.... which he did, dreams unrealized because I spent 4 minutes reading the menus.  lol, anyway that's my only complaint.  I hope the devs keep working on it and adding things... so if you see this, please add in an option to make the years last a little longer.  I want to be able to gloat as my fortunes begin to exceed everyone else's on the list.  Do I recommend this game?  Why yes I do... totally worth the asking price.",
